# The Jolly Balloon Man: "{1}, {T}: Create a token that's a copy of another target creature you control, except it's a 1/1 red
# Balloon creature in addition to its other colors and types and it has flying and haste" (CR 707.2, 707.9b, 111.1). The token copies
# Savannah Lions (a white 2/1 Cat), so it is a 1/1 white and red Cat Balloon creature with flying and haste; the real Savannah Lions
# is untouched, and Bot1 keeps its own Lions, Jolly Balloon Man (tapped for the cost) and the four Moxen.

